// 289's sheep, on the cache's varp 179, which cache 786's quest 173 ("Sheep
// Shearer") counts from 1 to 21, as 289's does. The cache does not transmit
// it and no clientscript reads it: 2011's miniquest has no quest list row
// (clientscript 2193), so it stays the server's, as 289's was.
[sheep]
scope=perm

// Whether the player has tried to shear The Thing, so Fred will hear of it
// (void-634's the_thing_interacted). Server-only.
[the_thing_interacted]
scope=perm
